// One of two effects with ONE processor name and two behaviours (ADR 0031; ADR 0029 §6): this one
// passes the left channel at half and silences the other. Loaded into one engine process beside its twin,
// each must run its own code, which an export built without the symbol flags does not.
processor Two [[ main ]]
{
    input stream float<2> in;
    output stream float<2> out;
    void main() { loop { let x = in; out <- float<2> (x[0] * 0.5f, 0.0f); advance(); } }
}
